{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壇也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦呪有身印、手印，作印誦呪法即易成。若未入壇，不得輙作。令誦此呪，即當入壇作印\n行用，不成盜法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下以反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧沒反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "登沒反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦此呪滅一切障，亦能辟魔，乃除天災。又，若誦一遍，禮佛一拜，如此日別三時\n誦呪禮佛，未來當得二相端正具足果報"}
